# 与官方 apm-httpclient-5.x-plugin (v9.4.0) 的全量替代: 同步入口加采集, 异步入口原样保留。
override-httpclient-5.x=org.apache.skywalking.apm.plugin.override.httpclient.v5.define.InternalHttpClientInstrumentation
override-httpclient-5.x=org.apache.skywalking.apm.plugin.override.httpclient.v5.define.MinimalHttpClientInstrumentation
override-httpclient-5.x=org.apache.skywalking.apm.plugin.override.httpclient.v5.define.HttpAsyncClientInstrumentation
override-httpclient-5.x=org.apache.skywalking.apm.plugin.override.httpclient.v5.define.IOSessionImplInstrumentation
# 运行时开关与 toolkit 增强由 override-httpclient-4.x-plugin 统一拥有(与 override-hutool 同模式),
# 本插件只读共享的 OverrideHttpClientPluginConfig, 不注册自己的 HttpClientParamRuntimeInstrumentation。
